   "en": "{07 0a 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Congrats,{01 00 00 0a 00} {0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}!\n{0b 03 00}{04 02 00}!\n\n{07 00 00}Oh, no reason in particular.{01 00 00 0a 00}\n{07 14 00}You just looked like you\nshould be congratulated!\n{07 00 00}So here! Take my\n{0b 02 00}{04 1a 00},\n{01 00 00 0a 00}OK, {04 02 00}?",
   "et": "{07 0a 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Palju õnne,{01 00 00 0a 00} {0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}!\n{0b 03 00}{04 02 00}!\n\n{07 00 00}Oh, ilma erilise põhjuseta.{01 00 00 0a 00}\n{07 14 00}Sa lihtsalt näisid selline,\nkeda tuleks õnnitleda!\n{07 00 00}Nii et säh! Võta minu\n{0b 02 00}{04 1a 00},\n{01 00 00 0a 00}eks, {04 02 00}?"
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "en": "{07 00 00}{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 14 00}{07 0c 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Amazing!{01 00 00 14 00} My dream is\nabout to come true,{01 00 00 05 00}\n{04 02 00}!\n{07 0d 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}I dreamed{01 00 00 05 00} that I gave you\na present{01 00 00 0a 00} here at {04 08 00}!\n\n{07 00 00}Wow.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 14 00} It's like fate or\ndestiny or something.{01 01 00}\n{07 13 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}This is so cool!\n{07 14 00}Here you go!{01 00 00 05 00} Take my\n{0b 02 00}{04 1a 00}!\n{01 00 00 14 00}{07 00 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}And treasure it always!",
   "et": "{07 00 00}{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 14 00}{07 0c 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Hämmastav!{01 00 00 14 00} Mu unistus\non täitumas,{01 00 00 05 00}\n{04 02 00}!\n{07 0d 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Nägin unes,{01 00 00 05 00} et andsin sulle\nkingituse{01 00 00 0a 00} siin, {04 08 00}!\n\n{07 00 00}Vau.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 14 00} See on nagu saatus\nvõi ettemääratus.{01 01 00}\n{07 13 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}See on nii lahe!\n{07 14 00}Säh!{01 00 00 05 00} Võta minu\n{0b 02 00}{04 1a 00}!\n{01 00 00 14 00}{07 00 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Ja hoia seda alati!"
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "en": "{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 0a 00}{07 0b 00}{01 00 00 05 00}Why do I get the feeling{01 00 00 0a 00}\nthat I was supposed to\ngive you something?\n{07 0e 00}Let's see{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 0a 00} What was it\nagain?{01 00 00 14 00} Think, {04 01 00}{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 14 00}\n{07 0c 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Oh!\n{07 00 00}That's right!{01 00 00 0a 00} I was supposed\nto give you my rockin'\n{0b 02 00}{04 1a 00}!{01 00 00 14 00}\n{07 14 00}Just take it, {04 1f 00}.{01 00 00 14 00}\nNo thanks necessary,{01 00 00 05 00}\n{04 02 00}!",
   "et": "{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 0a 00}{07 0b 00}{01 00 00 05 00}Miks mul on tunne,{01 00 00 0a 00}\net ma pidin sulle midagi\nandma?\n{07 0e 00}Vaatame{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 0a 00} Mis see oligi?\n{01 00 00 14 00} Mõtle, {04 01 00}{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 14 00}\n{07 0c 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Oh!\n{07 00 00}Täpselt!{01 00 00 0a 00} Ma pidin sulle\nandma oma vägeva\n{0b 02 00}{04 1a 00}!{01 00 00 14 00}\n{07 14 00}Võta lihtsalt, {04 1f 00}.{01 00 00 14 00}\nTänada pole vaja,{01 00 00 05 00}\n{04 02 00}!"
